{"corpus":"ccc","number":439,"text_html":"<span>De nombreux juifs et même certains païens qui partageaient leur espérance ont reconnu en Jésus les traits fondamentaux<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§547</sup> du « fils de David » messianique<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§528-529</sup> promis par Dieu à Israël <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. Jésus a accepté le titre de Messie auquel il avait droit <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">8</sup>, mais non sans réserve parce que celui-ci était compris par une partie de ses contemporains selon une conception trop humaine <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">10</sup>, essentiellement politique <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"11\">11</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["528-529","547"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mt 2:2"},{"text":"Mt 9:27"},{"text":"Mt 12:23"},{"text":"Mt 15:22"},{"text":"Mt 20:30"},{"text":"Mt 21:9"},{"text":"Mt 21:15"},{"text":"Jn 4:25-26"},{"text":"Jn 11:27"},{"text":"Mt 22:41-46"},{"text":"Jn 6:15"},{"text":"Lc 24:21"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 2:2","idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"9:27","idx":2,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"12:23","idx":3,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"15:22","idx":4,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"20:30","idx":5,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"21:9","idx":6,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"21:15","idx":7,"marker_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 4:25-26","idx":8},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"11:27","idx":9,"marker_idx":8},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 22:41-46","idx":10},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 6:15","idx":11},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 24:21","idx":12,"marker_idx":11}]}